"id":"/%E5%B8%B8%E8%A7%81%E9%97%AE%E9%A2%98-14","page_id":"/%E5%B8%B8%E8%A7%81%E9%97%AE%E9%A2%98","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/%E5%B8%B8%E8%A7%81%E9%97%AE%E9%A2%98","content":"**Q:** 为什么我没有选择任何背景源，背景也会变化？"},"151":{"id":"/%E5%B8%B8%E8%A7%81%E9%97%AE%E9%A2%98-15","page_id":"/%E5%B8%B8%E8%A7%81%E9%97%AE%E9%A2%98","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/%E5%B8%B8%E8%A7%81%E9%97%AE%E9%A2%98","content":"> `SimpTab` 有几个默认显示的源，并不在背景源列表中，所以会产生这种情况。\\\n> 默认显示的源，包括：`bing.com` 的历史图片、用户 `自行上传` 的图片、二十四节气（只在对应的日期显示）。"},"152":{"id":"/%E5%B8%B8%E8%A7%81%E9%97%AE%E9%A2%98-16","page_id":"/%E5%B8%B8%E8%A7%81%E9%97%AE%E9%A2%98","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/%E5%B8%B8%E8%A7%81%E9%97%AE%E9%A2%98","content":"**Q:** 为什么有的背景源加载较慢？"},"153":{"id":"/%E5%B8%B8%E8%A7%81%E9%97%AE%E9%A2%98-17","page_id":"/%E5%B8%B8%E8%A7%81%E9%97%AE%E9%A2%98","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/%E5%B8%B8%E8%A7%81%E9%97%AE%E9%A2%98","content":"> 由于国内的网络环境比较复杂，所以，并不是每个背景源都能访问到，所以最好手动在浏览器里面确认上述背景源是否可以打开。\\\n> 建议 `绿色上网` 。"},"154":{"id":"/%E5%B8%B8%E8%A7%81%E9%97%AE%E9%A2%98-18","page_id":"/%E5%B8%B8%E8%A7%81%E9%97%AE%E9%A2%98","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/%E5%B8%B8%E8%A7%81%E9%97%AE%E9%A2%98","content":"**Q:** 下载的背景源能否用作商业用途？"},"155":{"id":"/%E5%B8%B8%E8%A7%81%E9%97%AE%E9%A2%98-19","page_id":"/%E5%B8%B8%E8%A7%81%E9%97%AE%E9%A2%98","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/%E5%B8%B8%E8%A7%81%E9%97%AE%E9%A2%98","content":"> `SimpTab` 的背景源来自上述网址，具体请详细确认上述网站的授权协议。"},"156":{"id":"/%E5%B8%B8%E8%A7%81%E9%97%AE%E9%A2%98-20","page_id":"/%E5%B8%B8%E8%A7%81%E9%97%AE%E9%A2%98","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/%E5%B8%B8%E8%A7%81%E9%97%AE%E9%A2%98","content":"**Q:** 收藏 `Favorite` 的含义是什么？"},"157":{"id":"/%E5%B8%B8%E8%A7%81%E9%97%AE%E9%A2%98-21","page_id":"/%E5%B8%B8%E8%A7%81%E9%97%AE%E9%A2%98","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/%E5%B8%B8%E8%A7%81%E9%97%AE%E9%A2%98","content":"> 由于 `1.4.0` （含以上版本） 增加了很多背景源，导致同一张图片出现的几率非常小。 `SimpTab` 会随机读取 `Favorite` 中的数据，收藏后意味着下次出现这张背景的几率比较大。"},"158":{"id":"/%E5%B8%B8%E8%A7%81%E9%97%AE%E9%A2%98-22","page_id":"/%E5%B8%B8%E8%A7%81%E9%97%AE%E9%A2%98","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/%E5%B8%B8%E8%A7%81%E9%97%AE%E9%A2%98","content":"**Q:** `omnibox` 的用处是什么？"},"159":{"id":"/%E5%B8%B8%E8%A7%81%E9%97%AE%E9%A2%98-23","page_id":"/%E5%B8%B8%E8%A7%81%E9%97%AE%E9%A2%98","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/%E5%B8%B8%E8%A7%81%E9%97%AE%E9%A2%98","content":"> 为了方便某些只用键盘操作的，键盘控。比如我 ヽ(´▽\\`)/"},"160":{"id":"/%E5%B8%B8%E8%A7%81%E9%97%AE%E9%A2%98-24","page_id":"/%E5%B8%B8%E8%A7%81%E9%97%AE%E9%A2%98","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/%E5%B8%B8%E8%A7%81%E9%97%AE%E9%A2%98","content":"**Q:** 上传 `upload` 的图片都存在了哪里？"},"161":{"id":"/%E5%B8%B8%E8%A7%81%E9%97%AE%E9%A2%98-25","page_id":"/%E5%B8%B8%E8%A7%81%E9%97%AE%E9%A2%98","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/%E5%B8%B8%E8%A7%81%E9%97%AE%E9%A2%98","content":"> 由于 `Chrome` 的安全机制，所以 `上传` 的图片都存在了 `Chrome` 文件系统中，类似 `chrome-extension://xxxxxx/temporary/` 里面。\\\n> 安全性 与 `Chrome` 的安全性一致。"},"162":{"id":"/%E5%B8%B8%E8%A7%81%E9%97%AE%E9%A2%98-26","page_id":"/%E5%B8%B8%E8%A7%81%E9%97%AE%E9%A2%98","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/%E5%B8%B8%E8%A7%81%E9%97%AE%E9%A2%98","content":"**Q:** 上传 `upload` 的图片 如何管理？"},"163":{"id":"/%E5%B8%B8%E8%A7%81%E9%97%AE%E9%A2%98-27","page_id":"/%E5%B8%B8%E8%A7%81%E9%97%AE%E9%A2%98","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/%E5%B8%B8%E8%A7%81%E9%97%AE%E9%A2%98","content":"> `SimpTab` 暂时未提供管理功能，（ 后续版本将会提供支持 ）。如果全部删除的话，可以使用删除 `SimpTab` 的办法；如果逐一删除的话，当背景显示了某个需要删除的上传图片时，点击 `favorite` 即可删除。"},"164":{"id":"/%E5%B8%B8%E8%A7%81%E9%97%AE%E9%A2%98-28","page_id":"/%E5%B8%B8%E8%A7%81%E9%97%AE%E9%A2%98","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/%E5%B8%B8%E8%A7%81%E9%97%AE%E9%A2%98","content":"**Q:** 上传 `upload` 的图片 为什么 不马上显示？"},"165":{"id":"/%E5%B8%B8%E8%A7%81%E9%97%AE%E9%A2%98-29","page_id":"/%E5%B8%B8%E8%A7%81%E9%97%AE%E9%A2%98","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/%E5%B8%B8%E8%A7%81%E9%97%AE%E9%A2%98","content":"> 这是由 `SimpTab` 的背景显示机制决定，而且 `SimpTab` 暂时不具有 `上传图片` 即可显示的功能。"},"166":{"id":"/%E5%B8%B8%E8%A7%81%E9%97%AE%E9%A2%98-30","page_id":"/%E5%B8%B8%E8%A7%81%E9%97%AE%E9%A2%98","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/%E5%B8%B8%E8%A7%81%E9%97%AE%E9%A2%98","content":"**Q:** 如何知道 `当前背景` 来自哪个背景源？"},"167":{"id":"/%E5%B8%B8%E8%A7%81%E9%97%AE%E9%A2%98-31","page_id":"/%E5%B8%B8%E8%A7%81%E9%97%AE%E9%A2%98","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/%E5%B8%B8%E8%A7%81%E9%97%AE%E9%A2%98","content":"> 鼠标悬停到 `第四个图标` 上，稍等即可看到。"},"168":{"id":"/%E5%B8%B8%E8%A7%81%E9%97%AE%E9%A2%98-32","page_id":"/%E5%B8%B8%E8%A7%81%E9%97%AE%E9%A2%98","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/%E5%B8%B8%E8%A7%81%E9%97%AE%E9%A2%98","content":"**Q:** 为什么有的背景有 `详细信息` ，而有的背景没有。（ 详细信息指：第四个图标）"},"169":{"id":"/%E5%B8%B8%E8%A7%81%E9%97%AE%E9%A2%98-33","page_id":"/%E5%B8%B8%E8%A7%81%E9%97%AE%E9%A2%98","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/%E5%B8%B8%E8%A7%81%E9%97%AE%E9%A2%98","content":"> 因为有的背景源对应的背景有 `详细信息` ，所以显示；反之，有的没有，所以不显示。"},"170":{"id":"/%E5%B8%B8%E8%A7%81%E9%97%AE%E9%A2%98-34","page_id":"/%E5%B8%B8%E8%A7%81%E9%97%AE%E9%A2%98","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/%E5%B8%B8%E8%A7%81%E9%97%AE%E9%A2%98","content":"**Q:** 固定 `pin` 的含义？"},"171":{"id":"/%E5%B8%B8%E8%A7%81%E9%97%AE%E9%A2%98-35","page_id":"/%E5%B8%B8%E8%A7%81%E9%97%AE%E9%A2%98","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/%E5%B8%B8%E8%A7%81%E9%97%AE%E9%A2%98","content":"> 有的时候，希望某个背景停留的时间长一些，所以自然就有了 `pin` 功能。目前能 `pin` 的时间段包括： 半小时 → 8小时，且不可自定义。"},"172":{"id":"/%E5%B8%B8%E8%A7%81%E9%97%AE%E9%A2%98-36","page_id":"/%E5%B8%B8%E8%A7%81%E9%97%AE%E9%A2%98","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/%E5%B8%B8%E8%A7%81%E9%97%AE%E9%A2%98","content":"**Q:** 固定 `pin` 与 收藏 `favorite` 的区别？"},"173":{"id":"/%E5%B8%B8%E8%A7%81%E9%97%AE%E9%A2%98-37","page_id":"/%E5%B8%B8%E8%A7%81%E9%97%AE%E9%A2%98","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/%E5%B8%B8%E8%A7%81%E9%97%AE%E9%A2%98","content":"> 前者只是让当前背景停留一段时间，超过这段时间后，如果没有 `收藏` 的话，除非再加载到它，否则不会再显示了。\\\n> 后者会让当前图片保存到 `chrome-extension://xxxxxx/temporary/` 物理路径下，再显示的几率变大很多。"},"174":{"id":"/%E5%B8%B8%E8%A7%81%E9%97%AE%E9%A2%98-38","page_id":"/%E5%B8%B8%E8%A7%81%E9%97%AE%E9%A2%98","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/%E5%B8%B8%E8%A7%81%E9%97%AE%E9%A2%98","content":"**Q:** 固定 `pin` 超时后，为什么还不更换 新的背景。"},"175":{"id":"/%E5%B8%B8%E8%A7%81%E9%97%AE%E9%A2%98-39","page_id":"/%E5%B8%B8%E8%A7%81%E9%97%AE%E9%A2%98","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/%E5%B8%B8%E8%A7%81%E9%97%AE%E9%A2%98","content":"> 为了确保每次打开 `新标签页` 都是瞬间加载，所以 `SimpTab` 采用了 `预加载机制` 。\\\n> 超过 `pin` 所停留的时间后，第一次打开 `SimpTab` 会显示旧的背景，但同时 `加载新的背景` ，加载完毕后，再打开 `标签页` 就是显示新的背景。但加载有个 `时间差` ，当还未加载成功时，关闭了 `当前标签` ，所以 `新的背景` 还未加载成功，因此再打开时，还是之前的背景。"},"176":{"id":"/%E5%B8%B8%E8%A7%81%E9%97%AE%E9%A2%98-40","page_id":"/%E5%B8%B8%E8%A7%81%E9%97%AE%E9%A2%98","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/%E5%B8%B8%E8%A7%81%E9%97%AE%E9%A2%98","content":"**Q:** 固定 `pin` 8小时后，第二天（ `未超过8小时` ）为什么又加载了新的背景。"},"177":{"id":"/%E5%B8%B8%E8%A7%81%E9%97%AE%E9%A2%98-41","page_id":"/%E5%B8%B8%E8%A7%81%E9%97%AE%E9%A2%98","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/%E5%B8%B8%E8%A7%81%E9%97%AE%E9%A2%98","content":"> `SimpTab` 会在新的一天加载 `bing.com` 的背景，无论是否超过 `pin` 的时间。\\\n> 理论上 `第二天` 已经超过了 `pin` 的最大时间为 `8小时`，只有在夜晚的时候，那么，恭喜你是个夜猫子。 ^\\_^"},"178":{"id":"/%E5%B8%B8%E8%A7%81%E9%97%AE%E9%A2%98-42","page_id":"/%E5%B8%B8%E8%A7%81%E9%97%AE%E9%A2%98","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/%E5%B8%B8%E8%A7%81%E9%97%AE%E9%A2%98","content":"**Q:** 不喜欢（不再显示） `dislike` 的含义是什么？"},"179":{"id":"/%E5%B8%B8%E8%A7%81%E9%97%AE%E9%A2%98-43","page_id":"/%E5%B8%B8%E8%A7%81%E9%97%AE%E9%A2%98","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/%E5%B8%B8%E8%A7%81%E9%97%AE%E9%A2%98","content":"> 由于背景源比较多，自然会有些不喜欢的背景加载出来，所以加入了此功能。"},"180":{"id":"/%E5%B8%B8%E8%A7%81%E9%97%AE%E9%A2%98-44","page_id":"/%E5%B8%B8%E8%A7%81%E9%97%AE%E9%A2%98","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/%E5%B8%B8%E8%A7%81%E9%97%AE%E9%A2%98","content":"**Q:** 为什么选择了 不喜欢（不再显示） `dislike` 后，当前背景还再显示？"},"181":{"id":"/%E5%B8%B8%E8%A7%81%E9%97%AE%E9%A2%98-45","page_id":"/%E5%B8%B8%E8%A7%81%E9%97%AE%E9%A2%98","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/%E5%B8%B8%E8%A7%81%E9%97%AE%E9%A2%98","content":"> 同理于 `预加载机制`，只有新的背景加载完毕，并刷新后，才会显示新的背景。同时，被 `dislike` 的背景，将永远不会再出现。"},"182":{"id":"/%E5%B8%B8%E8%A7%81%E9%97%AE%E9%A2%98-46","page_id":"/%E5%B8%B8%E8%A7%81%E9%97%AE%E9%A2%98","